ot."]]}]}]},{"tag":"Escuta e diálogo","title":"My day","blocks":[{"type":"dialog","title":"My day","lines":[["Ana","What did you do today?","O que você fez hoje?"],["Leo","I made a plan and met a friend.","Fiz um plano e encontrei um amigo."],["Ana","Did you pay?","Você pagou?"],["Leo","Yes, I paid the bill.","Sim, paguei a conta."]]},{"type":"pron","title":"Pronúncia: Schwa /ə/","items":[{"label":"Schwa /ə/","note":"Vogais fracas viram /ə/: about, banana, today, the.","words":["about","banana","today","family","another"]}]}]},{"tag":"Fala","title":"Speaking","blocks":[{"type":"speak","title":"Speaking","prompts":[{"q":"Tell what you did today with irregular verbs.","pt":"Conte.","model":"I made lunch. I met a friend."},{"q":"Say what you said.","pt":"Diga.","model":"I said hello."},{"q":"Say what you read.","pt":"Diga.","model":"I read the news."}]}]},{"tag":"Escrita","title":"Writing","blocks":[{"type":"write","task":"Write a 4-line poem with irregular verbs.","model":"I made a plan, I met a friend, / I paid the bill, I read the end. / I ran to catch a morning train, / I said goodbye and smiled again.","checklist":["4 linhas","Usei **6 irregulares**","Rima"],"words":"4 linhas"}]},{"tag":"Revisão e exame","title":"Review · Exam strategy · Teacher’s note","blocks":[{"type":"mcq","title":"Check yourself","items":[{"q":"What does “bill” mean?","opts":["pegar","conta","adeus"],"ans":1,"why":"**bill** = conta."},{"q":"What does “catch” mean?","opts":["trem","plataforma","pegar"],"ans":2,"why":"**catch** = pegar."},{"q":"What does “train” mean?","opts":["trem","adeus","plano"],"ans":0,"why":"**train** = trem."},{"q":"What does “goodbye” mean?","opts":["plataforma","adeus","final"],"ans":1,"why":"**goodbye** = adeus."}]},{"type":"box","kind":"exam","t":"Estratégia para as provas","body":["Treine esta habilidade com o formato de tarefas curtas das provas (TOEFL/IELTS).","Leia o enunciado primeiro e procure as palavras-chave."]},{"type":"box","kind":"teach","t":"Nota para o